750 0 obj
<<
/Title (Function: `focus_window\(window_title\)` This function handles the OS-level UI integration. It utilizes `pygetwindow` or native `pyautogui` window handlers to locate a window whose title matches the provided substring. It then forces the Operating System to bring that window to the foreground, bypassing sleep states, preparing the UI for the subsequent automated keystroke injection.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
