754 0 obj
<<
/Title (Function: `run_retail_automation\(\)` This function serves as the central orchestrator for transaction synthesis. It leverages the `random` module to generate tightly constrained integers and floats, calculates the final receipt total, and manages the localized SQLite cursor connections. It is exclusively responsible for mutating the global `web_data` dictionary and invoking the socket emission payload. By consolidating state mutation here, the script prevents race conditions.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 756 0 R
/Next 750 0 R
>>
endobj
