756 0 obj
<<
/Title (Function: `monitor_and_heal\(target_app\)` This algorithm handles the core Service Reliability Engineering logic. It utilizes the `psutil` library to scan active hardware threads. Instead of allocating significant memory for a massive, static array of all active processes, the algorithm utilizes a highly optimized Python generator expression: `if target_app not in \(p.name\(\).lower\(\) for p in psutil.process_iter\(['name']\)\):`. If the target string is absent, it immediately executes `subprocess.Popen\(target_app\)` to force a localized application reboot. This is the cornerstone of the self-healing infrastructure.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 758 0 R
/Next 754 0 R
>>
endobj
757 0 obj
<<
